<title>USA: Indiana Community Bank increases dividend.</title>
<headline>Indiana Community Bank increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LEBANON, Ind. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indiana Community Bank confirmed Friday it raised its semi-annual dividend to $0.18 a share from $0.175.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable March 28 to shareholders of record February 28, a spokesman for the bank said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
